{"id": 981187, "slug": "mist-3", "name": "Mist", "name_original": "Mist", "description": "<h3>🌫️ A Dark RPG Journey Through the Mist</h3><p><strong>Mist</strong> is a gripping <strong>RPG adventure</strong> that blends story-driven exploration, character evolution, and chilling horror elements — all wrapped in an atmospheric idle experience.</p><p>👤 Start your path as a fragile human in a world overrun by alien horrors. Evolve, adapt, and become something far greater — or far more terrifying — in your quest to <strong>save your missing daughter</strong> and uncover the secrets hidden within the Mist.</p><h3>⚔️ RPG Progression with a Monstrous Twist</h3><p>Gain experience, unlock new abilities, and transform your appearance as you grow stronger. <strong>Your evolution changes everything</strong> — your powers, your look, even your morality.</p><p>Talk to survivors of the invasion — the Missourians. Friend or foe? <strong>Your choices shape the story</strong>. Decide who you trust, what you become, and how far you’re willing to go.</p><h3>🧬 Key Features:</h3><ul><li><p><strong>FIGHT</strong> hordes of alien enemies and face off against deadly bosses.</p></li><li><p><strong>EVOLVE</strong> your hero as you gain strength, transforming into a terrifying force.</p></li><li><p><strong>UNLOCK</strong> unique superpowers, search for resources, and uncover ancient totems.</p></li><li><p><strong>CHOOSE</strong> dialogue options that affect the story and relationships.</p></li><li><p><strong>EXPLORE</strong> 8 eerie, story-rich locations inspired by 90s America.</p></li><li><p><strong>IMMERSE</strong> yourself in a haunting horror RPG atmosphere with stunning visuals and sound.</p></li></ul><h3>🕹️ Idle Mechanics. Active Decisions.</h3><p>Enjoy a <strong>relaxing idle core</strong> that lets you grow even while you're away — but don't let your guard down. The world of Mist is dangerous, and every decision counts.</p><h3>🌑 Will You Remain Human… or Embrace the Monster Within?</h3><p>Dive into a dark RPG experience like no other. <strong>Download Mist now</strong> and step into the battle between light and darkness — your destiny awaits.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-05-01", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-05-16T11:10:33", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/fe7/fe7acc596568018fd8cdab64a485e4d7.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/961/9614b42fe04dacb0741f39173f96661e.jpg", "website": "https://euphoriagames.ru/", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 1, "added_by_status": {"yet": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 8, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 2, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 156, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_count": 0, "additions_count": 0, "game_series_count": 0, "user_game": null, "reviews_count": 0, "community_rating": 0, "saturated_color": "0f0f0f", "dominant_color": "0f0f0f", "parent_platforms": [{"platform": {"id": 1, "name": "PC", "slug": "pc"}}], "platforms": [{"platform": {"id": 4, "name": "PC", "slug": "pc", "image": null, "year_end": null, "year_start": null, "games_count": 562874, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/4be/4be6a6ad0364751a96229c56bf69be59.jpg"}, "released_at": "2025-05-14", "requirements": {"minimum": "Minimum:\nOS *: Windows 7,8,10\nProcessor: Intel Core TM i5 750\nMemory: 4 GB RAM\nGraphics: Sapphire Radeon HD 5770 1GB\nStorage: 1 GB available space\nAdditional Notes: With these requirements, it is recommended that the game is played on Low quality settings."}}], "stores": [{"id": 981916, "url": "", "store": {"id": 1, "name": "Steam", "slug": "steam", "domain": "store.steampowered.com