des of alien enemies and face off against deadly bosses.EVOLVE your hero as you gain strength, transforming into a terrifying force.UNLOCK unique superpowers, search for resources, and uncover ancient totems.CHOOSE dialogue options that affect the story and relationships.EXPLORE 8 eerie, story-rich locations inspired by 90s America.IMMERSE yourself in a haunting horror RPG atmosphere with stunning visuals and sound.🕹️ Idle Mechanics. Active Decisions.Enjoy a relaxing idle core that lets you grow even while you're away — but don't let your guard down. The world of Mist is dangerous, and every decision counts.🌑 Will You Remain Human… or Embrace the Monster Within?Dive into a dark RPG experience like no other. Download Mist now and step into the battle between light and darkness — your destiny awaits."}